<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Documentation on Apache HugeGraph</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/</link><description>Recent content in Documentation on Apache HugeGraph</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 05:29:51 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Download Apache HugeGraph</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/download/download/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/download/download/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Instructions:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;It is recommended to use the latest version of the HugeGraph software package. Please select Java11 for the runtime environment.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;To verify downloads, use the corresponding hash (SHA512), signature, and &lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/KEYS"&gt;Project Signature Verification KEYS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Instructions for checking hash (SHA512) and signatures are on the &lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/contribution-guidelines/validate-release/"&gt;Validate Release&lt;/a&gt; page, and you can also refer to &lt;a href="https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi#verify"&gt;ASF official instructions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Note: The version numbers of all components of HugeGraph have been kept consistent, and the version numbers of Maven repositories such as &lt;code&gt;client/loader/hubble/common&lt;/code&gt; are the same. You can refer to these for dependency references &lt;a href="https://github.com/apache/hugegraph-toolchain#maven-dependencies"&gt;maven example&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Compatibility note: after HugeGraph graduated in January 2026, download paths moved from &lt;code&gt;/incubator/hugegraph&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;/hugegraph&lt;/code&gt;. Historical release file names may still include &lt;code&gt;-incubating-&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="latest-version-170"&gt;Latest Version 1.7.0&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Release Date: 2025-11-28&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/changelog/hugegraph-1.7.0-release-notes/"&gt;Release Notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h4 id="binary-packages"&gt;Binary Packages&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="td-table-scroll td-table-scroll--static"&gt;&#10;&lt;table&gt;&#10; &lt;thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Server&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Toolchain&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;/tr&gt;&#10; &lt;/thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tbody&gt;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &lt;td&gt;[&lt;a href="https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz?action=download"&gt;Binary&lt;/a&gt;] [&lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz.asc"&gt;Sign&lt;/a&gt;] [&lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz.sha512"&gt;SHA512&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/td&gt;&#10; &lt;td&gt;[&lt;a href="https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-toolchain-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz?action=download"&gt;Binary&lt;/a&gt;] [&lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-toolchain-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz.asc"&gt;Sign&lt;/a&gt;] [&lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-toolchain-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz.sha512"&gt;SHA512&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/td&gt;&#10; &lt;/tr&gt;&#10; &lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h4 id="source-packages"&gt;Source Packages&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Please refer to &lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/quickstart/hugegraph/hugegraph-server/"&gt;build from source&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/cla/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/cla/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="contributor-agreement"&gt;Contributor Agreement&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="individual-contributor-exclusive-license-agreement"&gt;Individual Contributor exclusive License Agreement&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="including-the-traditional-patent-license-option"&gt;(including the TRADITIONAL PATENT LICENSE OPTION)&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in contributing to HugeGraph&amp;rsquo;s all projects (&amp;ldquo;We&amp;rdquo; or &amp;ldquo;Us&amp;rdquo;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this contributor agreement (&amp;ldquo;Agreement&amp;rdquo;) is to clarify and document the rights granted by contributors to Us. To make this document effective, please follow the comment of GitHub CLA-Assistant when submitting a new pull request.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/summary/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/summary/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="hugegraph-docs"&gt;HugeGraph Docs&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/download/download/"&gt;Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="quickstart"&gt;Quickstart&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/quickstart/hugegraph/hugegraph-server/"&gt;Install HugeGraph-Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/quickstart/toolchain/hugegraph-loader/"&gt;Load data with HugeGraph-Loader&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/l